# Ajani, Outland Chaperone, -8, with fewer cards in the library than X: a library with fewer cards shows what it has (CR 609.3), so
# the 16-life "top X" is just the three cards left: Rancor, Ornithopter and Beza. Rancor (an Aura, mana value 1) and Ornithopter are
# put onto the battlefield together; an Aura put onto the battlefield without being cast cannot enchant a permanent entering with
# it (CR 303.4f, 303.4h), so it enchants one of Bot1's three Kithkin tokens, not the Ornithopter. Beza (mana value 4) stays
# in the library, which is shuffled.
# Same route to 8 loyalty as the scenario with the full library: +1 on turns 1, 3 and 5, and two Tezzeret's Gambits.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Ajani, Outland Chaperone
Tezzeret's Gambit
